# derived/: the numbers analysis/ computes (JSON with a _meta provenance block, the two mean-delta vectors); tracked
!derived/**/*.json

# figures are tracked (like bridge-jspace): the PNGs, their styles-plot sidecars and the status registry; the
# numbers they read are in derived/ (tracked)
!figures/**/*.png
!figures/**/*.styles.json
!plots/status.csv

